ongsun Yuan in Liaodong, and was enfeoffed by Cao Wei as the King of Guided Righteousness for his merits, initially establishing his domain North of Jicheng. In the Western Jin, Murong Hui expanded their influence further, and his descendants founded regimes including Former Yan, Later Yan, Western Yan, and Southern Yan during the Sixteen Kingdoms period."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"5","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"慕容木延","height":"平均","shape":"较胖"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,65,70,75,72,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12006","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019105","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,65,70,75,72,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12006","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019105","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,65,70,75,72,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"80","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12006","armor":"WP1005805","helmet":"WP1019105","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0