ral Guanqiu Jian in the campaign against Goguryeo. For his distinguished military service, Cao Wei appointed him Minister and granted him the title of Worthy Prince of the Left.","jp":"鮮卑慕容部の人。部族の礎を築いた莫護跋の子。正始六年から泰始七年にかけて慕容部の首領を務め、父の志を継いで曹魏に臣従し続けた。その生涯で最も輝かしい瞬間は正始五年に訪れ、慕容木延は部族を率いて曹魏の名将・毌丘倹の高句麗遠征に従軍した。その赫々たる戦功により、曹魏から大都督および左賢王の封号を授けられた。","kr":"선비 모용부 사람으로, 기틀을 마련한 막호발의 아들이다. 정시 6년부터 태시 7년 사이에 모용부의 수장을 지냈으며, 부친의 뜻을 이어 계속해서 조위에 복속했다. 생애 가장 눈부신 활약을 펼친 때는 정시 5년으로, 무리를 이끌고 조위의 명장 관구검을 따라 고구려 정벌에 종군했다. 이때 세운 혁혁한 공으로 조위로부터 대도독 및 좌현왕의 봉호를 받았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1046315","remark":"粗壮","surname":"慕容","surnameTc":"慕容","surnameEn":"Murong","surnameJp":"慕容","surnameKr":"모용","surnameOther":"","name":"木延","nameTc":"木延","nameEn":"Muyan","nameJp":"木延","nameKr":"목연","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"慕容木延","power":"WJ10377","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"228","city":"CS1076","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"65","wise":"70","politics":"75","charm":"72","will":"75","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"26/37/34/65/32/32/38/30","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1001405;S1003705","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6300","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"5400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1010301;1001005;1001715","professions":"2/3/3/4/0/0/3/0/0/0/3/3/2/1/2/0/3/1/0/0/0/3/4/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"32","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","evaluate":"-1300","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"214","show":"228","death":"281","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npc